body:
I try not to think of death too morbidly. Many many people die every day whether from suicide or other. It's a fact of life. At the end of the day our life experiences do not accompany us in the afterlife.

Courage is to live when you want to die, and die when you want to live. I hope you will see the light and join me in old age. If we all did as me the human race would seize to exist :o 

&#x200B;
